OL,4,CFire safety work still pending three   
OL,5,Cyears on                               
OL,6,GA Southern Housing (SH) tenant says he 
OL,7,Gcontinues to have sleepless nights     
OL,8,Gthree years after a fire report        
OL,9,Gidentified multiple risks at his block 
OL,10,Gof flats.                              
OL,12,FMalcolm Preston, who lives at          
OL,13,FHumphreys House in Shoreham-by-Sea,    
OL,14,Fsaid there had been "no communication" 
OL,15,Fabout when high-risk cladding          
OL,16,Fidentified in 2023 would be replaced.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
