OL,4,CSir Norman Wisdom memorabilia set for  
OL,5,Cauction                                
OL,6,GRare memorabilia owned by a comedy     
OL,7,Glegend who grew up in Kent is due to   
OL,8,Ggo under the hammer at auction.        
OL,10,FSir Norman Wisdom, who lived as a      
OL,11,Ffoster child with his brother in Deal, 
OL,12,Fdied in 2010 at the age of 95 after a  
OL,13,Fstoried career in the entertainment    
OL,14,Findustry.                              
OL,16,FAmong the items being auctioned in     
OL,17,FDerby on Friday is Wisdom's original   
OL,18,Fbrown tweed Gump suit worn between     
OL,19,F1948 and 1953, early handwritten       
OL,20,Fscripts, photographs, and theatre      
OL,21,Fmemorabilia.                           
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
